==== Opening the case ====

**Note:** This will void your warranty!
  * To open the case, remove the 8 silver screws at the back.
  * Lift the plastic cover off the metal backside.
  * To remove the PCB, remove the two black screws near the LAN ports and the adhesive tape that holds the two antenna cables.
  * Remove the golden nuts, rings and plastic seals from the top antenna connectors.
  * Gently lift the PCB at the bottom until it's lifted from the heatsink pads.
  * Slide the PCB down to slip the top antenna connectors through the case openings and turn it around (be careful not to damage the antenna cables).
  * Disconnect the (glued) antenna cable connectors and remove the PCB. 

